<Base title="About" description="Meet Dhruv Goel and find his writing and GitHub profile.">
  <section class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A QUICK INTRODUCTION</p><h1>Hello, I’m Dhruv<span class="accent">.</span></h1><p class="intro">I’m a product leader passionate about AI, product strategy, and building tools that empower everyone.</p></section>
  <section class="about-grid"><div class="monogram" aria-hidden="true">dg.</div><div class="about-copy"><h2>A place to connect the dots.</h2><p>I started writing on Substack and am picking it up again. This site brings that writing together with the projects I’ll share along the way.</p><p>For now, you’ll find my first piece on Substack. You can also find me on GitHub.</p><div class="inline-links"><a class="text-link" href={site.substack}>Substack ↗</a><a class="text-link" href={site.github}>GitHub ↗</a></div></div></section>
</Base>
